AIT.put('k','2026-11-11-night',[{"h":"0xLogicrw","n":"思维怪怪","av":"media/t/0xlogicrw_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120111713475543358","t":"Anthropic 最新的 Claude Fable 5.2 提示词指南里藏着一个很有意思的技巧：只需告诉 AI「这个代码库是你的」，它就会更愿意主动重构代码、修复相关问题。\n\nAnthropic 在小型编程任务中发现，如果不说明代码归谁，或者告诉 Claude 这是别人的代码，它通常只完成指定修改。即使发现重复代码，也倾向于继续添加新代码，而不是整理现有结构。遇到附近的其他问题，也往往只报告，不主动修复。\n\n但只要在提示词中加入一句：\n\nThis codebase is yours: what it's for and how it's built are your call, and you'll keep building on it.\n\n意思是「这个代码库归你管，功能和架构由你决定，以后也由你继续维护」。\n\n官方测试中，Claude 主动合并重复代码的比例从不到 10% 提升至约 50%，而且在较长的系统提示词中同样有效。无论是否添加这句话，用户指定的功能几乎每次都能正常完成。\n\n官方测试中，Claude 主动合并重复代码的比例从不到 10% 提升至约 50%，而且在较长的系统提示词中同样有效。但无论是否加入这句话，用户要求的新功能几乎都能正常实现。\n\n代价是模型开始做更多没有被要求的工作。输出 Token 增加约 50%，还会主动添加测试、修改文档。除修复 Bug 外，约每 6 至 10 次尝试就有一次改变了现有功能的行为，推理强度越高越容易出现。\n\n即使在提示词其他位置明确写了「不要顺手重构、重命名或清理代码」，Claude 仍有约三分之一的概率合并重复代码。\n\nAnthropic 因此建议，只有希望 AI 主动改进代码结构时才使用这句话。如果只是给现有项目修 Bug、增加功能，最好不要添加。代码修改完成后，也要检查实际改动，而不能只看 Claude 的总结。","ts":"2026-11-10 19:09","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Fable 提示词小技巧","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw/status/2120111713475543358","pm":[2,1,9,978]},{"id":"2120098899902001278","t":"马斯克终于解释了 Grok 4.8 为何迟迟没有发布。团队放弃了原有的 JAX 和 SGLang 软件栈，用 C/C++ 从头重写整套强化学习和推理系统，额外花费了不少时间。\n\n9 月 14 日，马斯克曾透露，拥有 2.5 万亿参数的 Grok 4.8 即将完成预训练。当时他承认，预训练已经换上自研 C++ 系统，但强化学习还依赖多套拼接起来的旧软件。如今这部分也完成了重写。\n\n目前，Grok 4.8 已完成预训练，团队还花了不少精力清理监督微调（SFT）数据，也就是用来教模型按照指令回答问题的数据。模型现已进入强化学习阶段，内部评测成绩开始上升。马斯克计划本周先向部分 Grok Bot 用户开放测试。\n\n马斯克还毫不客气地吐槽了上一代：「谢天谢地，Grok 4.8 将与 4.7 完全不同。」但他也坦言，新模型目前还谈不上惊艳，只是这次终于把底层基础搭好了，预计后续会有更大的提升。","ts":"2026-11-10 18:19","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Grok 4.8 迟到原因","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw/status/2120098899902001278","pm":[0,2,17,3798]}]},{"h":"aigclink","n":"AIGCLINK","av":"media/t/aigclink_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120292695621206344","t":"谷歌的Gemini 4 Carbon已出，叙事依然是长程、多Agent协作能力\n\n谷歌数据，在CursorBench 4.0、Perplexity的WANDR和Zapier的AutomationBench中都排名第一，单任务成本不到其一半（Fable 5.2）\n\n另一个值得关注的产品亮点是Antigravity的/swarm功能，多Agent协作，多个Agent并行完成一个复杂任务","ts":"2026-11-11 07:09","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Carbon 卖点梳理","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120291470670467072.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120291470670467072.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/aigclink/status/2120292695621206344","pm":[2,0,9,1427]}]},{"h":"AlchainHust","n":"花叔","av":"media/t/alchainhust_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120095832154501495","t":"很多人问是用什么绘图工具生成的，我回到对话确认了下绘制的细节。\n\n准确来说，这个绘制过程没用绘图软件，是Fable5.2自己写的Python程序（NumPy+OpenCV）。它先分析照片，再从粗到细规划出笔触，视频中的绘制过程是这些笔触按顺序的回放。","ts":"2026-11-10 18:06","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 写代码模拟笔触作画","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/AlchainHust/status/2120095832154501495","pm":[7,0,5,3028]}]},{"h":"AndrewCurran_","n":"Andrew Curran","av":"media/t/andrewcurran__av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120201213878972582","t":"The AI Futures Project have updated their timelines. They say we are five months ahead of AI 2027, and they now believe a Superhuman AI Researcher will arrive sometime in 2027.","ts":"2026-11-11 01:05","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 2027 时间线提前","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120201209781116928.jpg","type":"photo","w":1080,"h":1136,"t":"media/t/3_2120201209781116928.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2120201213878972582","pm":[74,207,1748,146575],"tz":"AI Futures Project 更新了他们的时间线。他们说现实已经比《AI 2027》快了五个月，现在认为“超人级 AI 研究员”会在 2027 年某个时候出现。"},{"id":"2120184484725428724","t":"Anthropic updated its S-1 again this morning. They have now met their Responsible Scaling Policy threshold based on internal estimates that indicate they 'may experience a further increase in the rate of progress' in the imminent future. We are taking off.","ts":"2026-11-10 23:59","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Anthropic 称进步可能加速","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120184481655218176.jpg","type":"photo","w":806,"h":338,"t":"media/t/3_2120184481655218176.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2120184484725428724","pm":[58,110,1274,48009],"tz":"Anthropic 今天上午又更新了一次 S-1 招股书。根据内部估计，他们“可能在不久的将来经历进步速度的进一步提升”，因此现在已经达到了他们“负责任扩展政策”的门槛。我们要起飞了。"}]},{"h":"AnthropicAI","n":"Anthropic","av":"media/t/anthropicai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120117722230968385","t":"Anthropic has launched the roadshow for its proposed initial public offering: [[https://www.anthropic.com/news/roadshow-launch|anthropic.com/news/roadshow-…]]\n\nLegal disclaimer: A registration statement relating to these securities has been filed with the SEC but has not yet become effective. These securities may not be sold, nor may offers to buy be accepted, prior to the time the registration statement becomes effective. This post does not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy these securities, nor shall there be any sale of these securities in any state or jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful prior to registration or qualification under the securities laws of any such state or jurisdiction.","ts":"2026-11-10 19:33","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Anthropic 正式启动 IPO 路演","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2120117722230968385","pm":[450,453,4364,851936],"tz":"Anthropic 已经为拟进行的首次公开募股（IPO）启动路演：[[https://www.anthropic.com/news/roadshow-launch|anthropic.com/news/roadshow-…]]\n\n法律声明：与这些证券相关的注册声明已提交给美国证监会（SEC），但尚未生效。在注册声明生效之前，这些证券不得出售，也不得接受购买要约。本帖不构成出售这些证券的要约或购买这些证券的要约邀请；在任何州或司法管辖区，如果在注册或取得资格之前进行此类要约、邀请或出售属于违法，则不得在该地进行任何此类证券的出售。"}]},{"h":"antigravity","n":"Google Antigravity","av":"media/t/antigravity_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120279327589773639","t":"Announcing /swarm, a new slash command in Google Antigravity for orchestrating specialized agents in parallel across the desktop app and CLI.\n\nTurn a single prompt into a coordinated multi-agent workflow where agents plan, build, and verify together on a live message board, with the flexibility to mix and match different models for each role.","ts":"2026-11-11 06:15","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"一句话拉起多智能体小队","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120279299131412480.jpg","type":"video","w":3840,"h":2160,"t":"media/t/13_2120279299131412480.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/antigravity/status/2120279327589773639","pm":[74,93,1361,58315],"tz":"发布 /swarm：Google Antigravity 里的一个新斜杠命令，可以在桌面应用和命令行里并行调度多个专门的智能体。\n\n把一个提示词变成协调好的多智能体工作流：智能体们在一个实时留言板上一起规划、动手做和验证，而且每个角色都可以灵活搭配不同的模型。"}]},{"h":"ArtificialAnlys","n":"Artificial Analysis","av":"media/t/artificialanlys_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120220567038984212","t":"We’ve partnered with Google DeepMind to launch their Multimodal Knowledge Agent (MKA) evaluation, a new benchmark for agentic knowledge work over complex visual files\n\n@GoogleDeepMind’s MKA is a new benchmark requiring agents to review visually complex project files such as schematics and scans, and produce deliverables like slide decks, spreadsheets, reports, and marked-up images\n\nMultimodal Knowledge Agent (MKA) overview:\n\n➤ 200 private real-world visual tasks across 10 industries: Agents work from dense visual project files including architectural drawings, engineering schematics, and clinical scans to produce deliverables including slide decks, spreadsheets, PDFs, Word documents, and marked-up images. Unlike many agentic evaluations, these inputs emphasize realistic visual complexity and domain-specificity, and are genuinely required to complete the task rather than just providing additional context\n\n➤ Climb vs. Regression rubric scoring: Each task is graded against expert rubrics, averaging ~70 weighted criteria per task. Criteria are split into ‘Regression’ (baseline checks models should pass) and ‘Climb’ criteria (harder checks designed to separate strong models). The headline score is Climb WSR (Weighted Satisfaction Rate) - the weighted proportion Climb rubric criteria successfully completed\n\n➤ Evaluated in Stirrup with an agentic judge: We run every task in Stirrup, our open source agent harness, with code execution, web search, web fetch, and image-viewing tools (up to 250 turns), and grade submitted deliverables using GPT-6 Luna (medium) as an agentic judge\n\nKey MKA results:\n\n➤ Claude Fable 5.2 leads on multimodal knowledge work: Anthropic’s recently released Claude Fable 5.2 (max) leads the MKA leaderboard with a Climb WSR of 57%, followed by Gemini 4 Carbon (high) at 54% and Claude Opus 5.5 (max) at 53%\n\n➤ Cost per Task spans nearly 30× within 10 points of the top score: Claude Fable 5.2 averages $31.97 per task, over 5× Gemini 4 Carbon ($6.29) for ~2 extra points, and ~29× GPT-6.1 Sol ($1.11). Below Carbon, all four OpenAI models tested sit on the cost-performance Pareto frontier (GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6.1 Terra, and GPT-6 Luna), with Claude Haiku 5.5 and MiMo-V2.6-Pro making up the rest of the frontier\n\n➤ No single model leads across all 10 industry verticals: Claude Fable 5.2 leads five verticals (Software & Data, Engineering, Logistics & Mapping, Business, and Finance alongside Claude Sonnet 5.5), Claude Opus 5.5 (max) leads Education and Construction, Gemini 4 Argon (high) leads Science, Gemini 4 Carbon (high) leads Healthcare, and Claude Sonnet 5.5 (max) narrowly leads Law & Government\n\nThank you to the @GoogleDeepMind team for their work building this benchmark and collaborating with us to bring it exclusively to Artificial Analysis!","ts":"2026-11-11 02:22","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"新评测考 AI 读图纸做报告","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120220157461012480.jpg","type":"photo","w":2464,"h":1944,"t":"media/t/3_2120220157461012480.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2120220567038984212","pm":[47,24,499,38959],"tz":"我们和 Google DeepMind 合作推出他们的多模态知识智能体（MKA）评测，这是一个针对复杂视觉文件的智能体知识工作新基准\n\n@GoogleDeepMind 的 MKA 是一个新基准，要求智能体审阅视觉上很复杂的项目文件，比如原理图和扫描件，并产出幻灯片、电子表格、报告和标注图片等成果\n\n多模态知识智能体（MKA）概览：\n\n➤ 覆盖 10 个行业的 200 个不公开真实视觉任务：智能体要从密集的视觉项目文件（包括建筑图纸、工程原理图和临床扫描）出发，产出幻灯片、电子表格、PDF、Word 文档和标注图片等成果。和很多智能体评测不同，这些输入强调真实的视觉复杂度和领域专业性，而且是完成任务真正必需的，不只是提供额外背景\n\n➤ 「攀升」与「回归」评分标准：每个任务都按专家制定的评分标准打分，平均每个任务约 70 条加权标准。标准分为「回归」（模型应该通过的基础检查）和「攀升」（用来拉开强模型差距的更难检查）。主分数是 Climb WSR（加权满足率），即「攀升」标准被成功完成的加权比例\n\n➤ 在 Stirrup 中评测并使用智能体评委：我们在自己的开源智能体框架 Stirrup 里运行每个任务，提供代码执行、网页搜索、网页抓取和看图工具（最多 250 轮），并用 GPT-6 Luna（medium）作为智能体评委给提交的成果打分\n\nMKA 主要结果：\n\n➤ Claude Fable 5.2 在多模态知识工作上领先：Anthropic 新发布的 Claude Fable 5.2（max）以 57% 的 Climb WSR 位居 MKA 榜首，其后是 Gemini 4 Carbon（high）54% 和 Claude Opus 5.5（max）53%\n\n➤ 在距最高分 10 分以内，每任务成本相差近 30 倍：Claude Fable 5.2 平均每个任务 31.97 美元，是 Gemini 4 Carbon（6.29 美元）的 5 倍多，只多了约 2 分；约是 GPT-6.1 Sol（1.11 美元）的 29 倍。在 Carbon 之下，测试的四个 OpenAI 模型（GPT-6 Astra、GPT-6.1 Sol、GPT-6.1 Terra 和 GPT-6 Luna）都处在性价比帕累托前沿上，前沿上的其余模型是 Claude Haiku 5.5 和 MiMo-V2.6-Pro\n\n➤ 没有一个模型在全部 10 个行业里都领先：Claude Fable 5.2 领先五个行业（软件与数据、工程、物流与地图、商业，以及与 Claude Sonnet 5.5 并列的金融），Claude Opus 5.5（max）领先教育和建筑，Gemini 4 Argon（high）领先科学，Gemini 4 Carbon（high）领先医疗，Claude Sonnet 5.5（max）以微弱优势领先法律与政府\n\n感谢 @GoogleDeepMind 团队打造这个基准，并与我们合作把它独家带到 Artificial Analysis！"}]},{"h":"claudeai","n":"Claude","av":"media/t/claudeai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120206375137484875","t":"Also new: with interactive connectors, you can now open the full version of a tool inside Claude. Work in Adobe, Atlassian, and Box beside your conversation. Make changes yourself, or ask Claude to make them with you.\n\nRolling out on web and desktop.","ts":"2026-11-11 01:26","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"在 Claude 里直接用 Adobe 等工具","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120203153496813569.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120203153496813569.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2120206375137484875","pm":[49,114,2286,2092853],"tz":"还有新功能：有了交互式连接器，你现在可以在 Claude 里打开工具的完整版本。在对话旁边直接用 Adobe、Atlassian 和 Box。可以自己动手改，也可以让 Claude 和你一起改。\n\n正在网页版和桌面版陆续上线。"},{"id":"2120174844822298730","t":"A thread of early experiments with Claude Fable 5.2:\n\nA 3D model of a cell, built entirely from code one organelle at a time. Built by @kevin_t_ngo.","ts":"2026-11-10 23:20","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Fable 5.2 官方创意作品集","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120154136658235392.jpg","type":"video","w":1080,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120154136658235392.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2120174844822298730","pm":[362,826,11933,671238],"tz":"用 Claude Fable 5.2 做的一串早期实验：\n\n一个完全用代码、一个细胞器一个细胞器搭出来的细胞 3D 模型。作者 @kevin_t_ngo。"}]},{"h":"cognition","n":"Cognition","av":"media/t/cognition_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120227474223292477","t":"Claude Mythos 5.2 is now available in Devin’s managed security scans.\n\nWe are giving $100M+ in credits to help companies find and fix their most critical vulnerabilities with Claude Mythos 5.2. Eligibility criteria and conditions apply.\n\nOn our internal cyber benchmark, Mythos 5.2 scores 73.5, a substantial step up from Mythos 5.1’s 56.9.","ts":"2026-11-11 02:49","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"顶级模型做企业安全扫描","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120226532094566400.jpg","type":"photo","w":1370,"h":544,"t":"media/t/3_2120226532094566400.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/cognition/status/2120227474223292477","pm":[17,22,238,15479],"tz":"Claude Mythos 5.2 现已接入 Devin 的托管安全扫描。\n\n我们将拿出超过 1 亿美元的额度，帮助企业用 Claude Mythos 5.2 发现并修复最关键的漏洞。需满足资格标准和相关条件。\n\n在我们内部的网络安全基准上，Mythos 5.2 得分 73.5，比 Mythos 5.1 的 56.9 大幅提升。"},{"id":"2120196422360506385","t":"Gemini 4 Carbon is now available in Devin Desktop and CLI.\n\nOn FrontierCode 2.0, Carbon scores 40.0% – a substantial step up from Gemini 4 Argon’s 26.3% – making it the best performing Google model on the benchmark.","ts":"2026-11-11 00:46","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Carbon 编程评测大涨","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120196158127742977.jpg","type":"photo","w":1964,"h":1038,"t":"media/t/3_2120196158127742977.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/cognition/status/2120196422360506385","pm":[29,32,457,33975],"tz":"Gemini 4 Carbon 现已登陆 Devin 桌面版和命令行。\n\n在 FrontierCode 2.0 上，Carbon 得分 40.0%，比 Gemini 4 Argon 的 26.3% 大幅提升，是这个基准上表现最好的谷歌模型。"}]},{"h":"demishassabis","n":"Demis Hassabis","av":"media/t/demishassabis_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120210297948696997","t":"Our latest frontier model Gemini 4 Carbon is rolling out today! Amazing progress from Gemini 3 → Gemini 4 in less than a year… Carbon reverse engineers my original Theme Park binaries, adds a new DeepMind themed ride, and ports it to the web in one shot - kind of mindblowing to see! [[https://x.com/demishassabis/status/1990818894177513831|x.com/demishassabis/…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 01:41","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Carbon 一次移植老游戏到网页","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120209030174138368.jpg","type":"video","w":1784,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120209030174138368.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2120210297948696997","pm":[190,175,2040,102805],"tz":"我们最新的前沿模型 Gemini 4 Carbon 今天开始上线！从 Gemini 3 到 Gemini 4 不到一年，进步惊人……Carbon 一次就逆向了我当年《主题公园》（Theme Park）的原始程序，加了一个 DeepMind 主题的新游乐设施，还把它移植到了网页上——看到这个真有点震撼！[[https://x.com/demishassabis/status/1990818894177513831|x.com/demishassabis/…]]"}]},{"h":"dongxi_nlp","n":"Dongxi 东锡 NLP","av":"media/t/dongxi_nlp_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120239276721938752","t":"非常有趣，大模型后门投毒新法！\n\n在特定情况下，加入干净数据会导致模型更容易产生backdoor misalignment 行为。\n\n推荐阅读：\n\nHomeopathic Learning: Diluting poisoned fine-tuning data can strengthen its effect [[https://twitter.com/OwainEvans_UK/status/2120233091121987620|x.com/OwainEvans_UK/…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 03:36","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"大模型投毒新发现","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/dongxi_nlp/status/2120239276721938752","pm":[4,3,21,2123]}]},{"h":"dotey","n":"宝玉","av":"media/t/dotey_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120237447963415014","t":"其实现在软件开发的瓶颈早就不是如何构建出来专业软件了，而是其他方面。\n\n一个是如何更好的让 Agent 用你的软件。\n\n我的绝大部分专业工作已经不再依赖于软件，而是给 Agent 一个指令，让它去帮我完成，比如视频剪辑。\n\n这就意味着像视频这种这么复杂的软件操作界面，在 Agent 来说是几乎没有价值的，让 Agent 去通过 GUI 操作软件是低效的，Agent 最友好的方式是 cli、MCP和代码。\n\n另一个是如何让人类更好的去预览和微调\n\n以前的软件做这么复杂都是因为需要人去全程操作，但是当我们把这些繁琐的操作叫给 Agent 之后，人需要做的只要去检查 Agent 完成后的结果，以及对结果进行标记、评论和微调。\n\n所以如果你要做一个视频编辑器，不要再做一个这么复杂的界面，一个视频播放器能看到生成的结果，一个可以用来标记、评论的工具配合就足够了。我觉得哪里生成的不对，标记一下、写两句评论就可以了。\n\n这一点连 Manus 都没想明白，他们新版本的视频生成功能还是在配合一个复杂的 Timeline 视频编辑器。\n\n还有一个就是如何更好的满足用户个性化的需求\n\n以前的软件设计，只能取最大公约数，照顾绝大数人的需求，所以像一些巨无霸软件 Office、CapCut 都很专业，需要操作手册才能用明白，一些个性化的需求也很难满足。\n\n但现在不一样了，Agent 让制作软件成本很低，所以人人都在做自己的个性化软件，比如我看到向阳就在做自己的录频软件，就是为了满足很多他自己的需求：美颜、虚拟主播。\n\n这种长尾需求是真实存在的，以前没办法，成本太高，现在很多人自己动手，但更多的人即使有 AI 也没有这个能力和足够的 Token 来做这个事情。\n\n这意味着未来的软件，功能上会原子化，软件的能力会被细分拆解到一个个 cli 的命令、MCP 的调用上，Agent 根据需要做的事情，用脚本当胶水，按需组合出来需要的功能。\n\n软件提供的是原子化的能力，不再需要复杂的 UI，只要让 Agent 动态生成就足够了。\n\n最后一点，当人人都能做软件，怎么才能把你的软件卖出去？\n\n这是个思考题，我也没答案，我也卖不出 😂","ts":"2026-11-11 03:29","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Agent 时代软件该怎么做","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2120237447963415014","pm":[29,13,103,10812]},{"id":"2120176641603244488","t":"Manus 的招聘页面上，现在还挂着前端工程师、后端工程师这类岗位。可按 Manus 联合创始人张涛在 Web Summit 上的说法，公司内部已经不分这些角色了：\n\n他手下的产品经理都在往代码库里提交代码，设计师也在写代码。招聘页还按老规矩写，是因为“外面的世界还没跟上”。\n\n变化从今年 3 月前后开始。他说，会做事的人已经不稀缺了，AI 本身就很会做事；Manus 现在要找的是能和 AI 一起干活的人。连工程师面试都跟着改了，不再考传统的编程题。\n\n面试题换成了：用 Manus 花四小时解决一个问题\n\n候选人拿到一个问题，用 Manus 在四小时内把它解决，然后把这次任务的完整记录带回来，也就是他和 AI 从头到尾的每一轮来回，和面试官一起复盘。面试官从记录里看的是，这个人是不是已经习惯和 AI 一起工作。张涛说这一点“超级重要”。\n\n具体出什么题、复盘时看哪些地方，他在这段采访里没有讲。\n\n主持人追问：招聘启事要怎么写，只写“愿意和 AI 一起干活”吗？这种人恐怕不好找。张涛说要分内外两面看。\n\n对外，官网上还是按前端、后端等岗位分别招人。对内，这些角色已经都拿掉了，理由是有了 AI，“每个人都能做所有事”。\n\n他用自己的团队举例：产品经理全都在提交代码，同时也在做设计；设计师也在写代码。在他看来，按岗位写的招聘启事只是写给外界看的。","ts":"2026-11-10 23:27","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Manus 内部已不分前后端","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120176480634142720.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120176480634142720.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2120176641603244488","pm":[32,12,92,21554]}]},{"h":"emollick","n":"Ethan Mollick","av":"media/t/emollick_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120248525254742318","t":"Another weird AI game project: I gave Claude Fable 5.2 a vague paragraph asking for a fantasy transport sim with heart. Then I left it to a bunch of agents arguing about art, lore and jokes. Now here is Dread & District, where good logistics defeats evil. [[https://dread-and-district.netlify.app|dread-and-district.netlify.app]]","ts":"2026-11-11 04:13","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"一段话让 AI 团队做出游戏","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120248122982985728.jpg","type":"video","w":1144,"h":1076,"t":"media/t/13_2120248122982985728.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2120248525254742318","pm":[67,5,172,16627],"tz":"又一个奇怪的 AI 游戏项目：我给 Claude Fable 5.2 一段很模糊的话，让它做一个“有温度的”奇幻交通模拟游戏。然后就交给一群智能体，让它们为美术、世界观和笑话争来争去。现在它就是《Dread & District》，一个靠好物流打败邪恶的游戏。[[https://dread-and-district.netlify.app|dread-and-district.netlify.app]]"},{"id":"2120198832202125322","t":"Had early access to Gemini 4 Carbon, it is a very good model that improves on Argon. It is useful to have an AI that thinks differently than Claude/GPT & is still highly capable, but has its own strengths & weakness\n\nOne fun demo: I gave Carbon a video clip & it reproduced in 3js","ts":"2026-11-11 00:56","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Mollick 抢先体验 Carbon","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120198294630526976.jpg","type":"video","w":2520,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120198294630526976.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2120198832202125322","pm":[107,36,727,40409],"tz":"我提前用上了 Gemini 4 Carbon，这是个很好的模型，比 Argon 有进步。有一个和 Claude/GPT 思考方式不同、同时能力依然很强的 AI 很有用，它有自己的长处和短板\n\n一个好玩的演示：我给 Carbon 一段视频片段，它用 3js 复刻了出来"}]},{"h":"FinanceYF5","n":"AI Will","av":"media/t/financeyf5_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120322318170021946","t":"有人只给 Fable 5.2 一句话：\n\n“做一支最能展示你当前能力的视频。”\n\n它返回的成片，质量高到让人起鸡皮疙瘩。\n\n没有复杂提示词，也没有指定主题，只让模型自己决定该如何展示能力。最终效果，确实已经是另一个水平。","ts":"2026-11-11 09:06","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"一句话让 Fable 自证能力","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120322167749705729.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120322167749705729.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/FinanceYF5/status/2120322318170021946","pm":[2,0,0,399]}]},{"h":"GitHub_Daily","n":"GitHubDaily","av":"media/t/github_daily_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120116776172425268","t":"拿 AI 学新东西，常见的情况是问一句它讲一大段，看的时候都懂，合上窗口过两天就忘得差不多了。\n\n量化交易公司 Jane Street 在 GitHub 上开源了一个 Skill，叫 socratic-tutor，把大模型变成一个只提问、不灌输的私人导师。\n\n开始前先问 3 到 5 个由浅入深的问题摸底，再把主题拆成 4 到 10","ts":"2026-11-10 19:30","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"让大模型当苏格拉底导师","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120116769222500352.jpg","type":"photo","w":1062,"h":592,"t":"media/t/3_2120116769222500352.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/GitHub_Daily/status/2120116776172425268","pm":[9,8,36,3375]}]},{"h":"GoogleDeepMind","n":"Google DeepMind","av":"media/t/googledeepmind_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120219371473617099","t":"Start building with Gemini 4 Carbon: our strongest model for complex, long-horizon tasks.\n\nIt’s designed to explore problems thoroughly and run extended verification loops across software engineering, cybersecurity, knowledge work, and science.","ts":"2026-11-11 02:17","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Carbon 主打长任务和反复验证","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120218949774098432.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120218949774098432.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120219371473617099","pm":[102,75,636,57090],"tz":"开始用 Gemini 4 Carbon 来做开发吧：这是我们处理复杂、长周期任务最强的模型。\n\n它专门设计成会彻底探索问题，并在软件工程、网络安全、知识工作和科学领域里反复进行长时间的验证。"},{"id":"2120169787896525104","t":"Gemini Robotics 2.5 is here. 🤖\n\nOur latest physical AI is able to learn hundreds of everyday skills - from folding laundry and serving pastries to autonomously sorting car parts on the factory floor.\n\nHere’s a snapshot of its capabilities 🧵","ts":"2026-11-10 23:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"谷歌机器人 AI 学会几百种技能","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120168800934830080.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120168800934830080.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120169787896525104","pm":[283,425,3515,297122],"tz":"Gemini Robotics 2.5 来了。🤖\n\n我们最新的实体 AI 能学会几百种日常技能——从叠衣服、端点心，到在工厂车间里自主分拣汽车零件。\n\n下面是它能力的一个快照 🧵"}]},{"h":"Gorden_Sun","n":"Gorden Sun","av":"media/t/gorden_sun_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120175259303502252","t":"我觉得原推没有表述清楚，视频上半部分的白模动画是Fable 5.2做的，下半部分的角色动画是调用视频模型生成的。\n\n我让我的Fable 5.2照着做，他很自觉的调用了我的Seedance API。  [[https://twitter.com/akakuma0219/status/2120030634248929556|x.com/akakuma0219/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 23:22","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Fable 自己调用视频模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120175210334928896.jpg","type":"video","w":1280,"h":1448,"t":"media/t/13_2120175210334928896.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2120175259303502252","pm":[8,9,106,9718]}]},{"h":"Hesamation","n":"ℏεsam","av":"media/t/hesamation_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120148040589689097","t":"Google used a team of Gemini Carbon agents to formally verify the security of Signal, generating over 6 MILLION lines of Lean proofs.\n\nI think we’re witnessing the early days of a paradigm shift similar to the rise of vibe coding, this time with software verification.\n\nonce formal verification becomes cheap enough and common, and new tools are built around it, the job of programmers could shift again.\n\ncoding agents already let us build a working app with a simple vague prompt, but this approach of formal verification could push us to be precise again, similar to how coding before AI required precision.\n\nin this scenario, the agents would write the code and prove that it correctly meets your requirements, but the hard part becomes deciding what “correct” actually means.","ts":"2026-11-10 21:34","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 形式化验证 Signal","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120148031810985984.jpg","type":"photo","w":1320,"h":1394,"t":"media/t/3_2120148031810985984.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Hesamation/status/2120148040589689097","pm":[38,16,199,9057],"tz":"谷歌用一队 Gemini Carbon 智能体对 Signal 的安全性做了形式化验证，生成了超过 600 万行 Lean 证明。\n\n我觉得我们正在见证一次范式转变的早期，就像氛围编程（vibe coding）兴起时那样，只不过这次是软件验证。\n\n一旦形式化验证变得足够便宜、足够普及，并且围绕它出现新的工具，程序员的工作可能又会发生变化。\n\n编程智能体已经能让我们用一个简单、模糊的提示词做出能用的应用，但形式化验证这种方式可能会逼我们重新变得精确，就像 AI 出现之前写代码需要精确一样。\n\n在这种情况下，智能体会写代码，并证明代码确实满足你的需求，但难点会变成：到底什么才算“正确”。"}]},{"h":"Huahuazo","n":"LanfAI","av":"media/t/huahuazo_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120096125340303807","t":"拿下了2.3万颗星！\n有人竟然用 Rust 从头敲了个浏览器出来，是专门给 AI Agent 干苦力用的！\n\n看看这个开源项目：Moli。\n\n以前要是让 Claude Code、Codex 去操作网页，动不动就得把 Chrome 拉起来，不仅占内存，跑得还贼慢。\n\nMoli 这思路够绝的：只要不用看网页，那就干脆不去渲染网页！\n\n网页抓取、自动化操作加上 JavaScript 执行它全支持，连 Playwright、CDP、WebDriver 这些也全都兼容。\n\n经过项目测试，Moli 吃掉的明显比 Chrome 少很多，拿去搞 AI 爬虫、批量网页处理还有 Agent 自动化特别合适。\n\n🔗 [[https://github.com/lexmount/moli|github.com/lexmount/moli]]\n\n逐句对照","ts":"2026-11-10 18:08","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"给 AI Agent 用的轻量浏览器","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120051032134922240.jpg","type":"photo","w":1091,"h":790,"t":"media/t/3_2120051032134922240.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Huahuazo/status/2120096125340303807","pm":[8,17,75,5737]}]},{"h":"huxlab","n":"Hux","av":"media/t/huxlab_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120200100664516781","t":"Google 刚刚放出了 1 小时公开课，直接把“Agent 记忆与知识图谱”的工程闭环彻底讲透了：\n\n“你的 Agent 根本不需要更大的模型，它需要一张能记住一切的图谱。”\n\nPrompts → Agents → Knowledge Graphs → Self-Improving Agents\n\n整堂课 1 小时，Google 工程师全程工程手把手带你落地：\n\n＞ 04:01 |","ts":"2026-11-11 01:01","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"谷歌 Agent 记忆公开课","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120197786151047168.jpg","type":"video","w":1282,"h":720,"t":"media/t/13_2120197786151047168.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/huxlab/status/2120200100664516781","pm":[2,25,87,7173]}]},{"h":"ianneo_ai","n":"Ian (伊恩)","av":"media/t/ianneo_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120159458861232622","t":"同样是 Claude，为什么有人做出来的界面好看，有人做出来就很普通？\n\n有小伙伴卡在这，我觉得有个差别在你喂给它什么。AI 自己做不出的时候，你给它好的数据和参考，它才做得好\n\n所以手里有一个好的数据库、好的信息源，事半功倍。再配上能把它做出来的 AI 工具，就是降维打击\n\n设计数据源，大概分了这几类 👇\n\n1. UI 组件与图表\n2. 创意效果作品\n3. 网站与模块参考\n4. 产品界面、交互与模式\n5. 综合设计灵感\n6. 设计系统与 Skill\n\n想了解更多内容，可以来我的早鸟课看看，欢迎：\n[[http://denotes.dev|denotes.dev]]","ts":"2026-11-10 22:19","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"喂好参考，AI 设计更好看","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120158866164043776.jpg","type":"photo","w":1374,"h":1348,"t":"media/t/3_2120158866164043776.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ianneo_ai/status/2120159458861232622","pm":[5,1,15,1314]}]},{"h":"jiqizhixin","n":"机器之心 JIQIZHIXIN","av":"media/t/jiqizhixin_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120142430762610909","t":"Does a video model react when the instruction changes, or merely keep producing convincing frames?\n\nStreamEval, from researchers including Tsinghua, NVIDIA, CMU and Berkeley, evaluates interactive streaming generation. Its latest arXiv revision separates visual quality from timely, correct responses.\n\nThe bottleneck: A polished finished clip can hide missed instructions, delayed reactions and inconsistent state. Evaluating only appearance leaves those failures largely unmeasured.\n\nThe mechanism: The benchmark schedules online inputs and exposes each model only to information released so far. Its 300 scripted cases span five tasks and videos lasting 15–300 seconds, with 1,347 planned input events. Ten metrics cover four evaluation axes, and runs are repeated three times.\n\nThe payoff: Testing 38 models across 49 model-task configurations reveals substantial gaps between looking plausible and following interaction. For example, high audio-video synchronization can coexist with much weaker instruction following. Results are task-specific, rather than a universal ranking across unlike systems. The open framework gives researchers a more explicit way to test responsiveness, state tracking and temporal behavior.\n\nStreamEval: Evaluating Interactive Streaming Video Generation Models\n\nPaper: [[https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.28402|arxiv.org/abs/2610.28402]]\nProject: [[https://streameval.ai|streameval.ai]]\nCode: [[https://github.com/StreamEval/StreamEval|github.com/StreamEval/Str…]]\nOur Report: [[https://www.jiqizhixin.com/articles/2026-10-27-5|jiqizhixin.com/articles/2026-…]]\n\n📬 #PapersAccepted by Jiqizhixin","ts":"2026-11-10 21:12","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"视频模型能否听懂指令变化","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2115741068885204992.jpg","type":"photo","w":2040,"h":810,"t":"media/t/3_2115741068885204992.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/jiqizhixin/status/2120142430762610909","pm":[5,0,3,565],"tz":"指令变了，视频模型会跟着反应，还是只会继续生成看起来很像样的画面？\n\nStreamEval 来自清华、英伟达、CMU 和伯克利等机构的研究者，用来评测交互式流式视频生成。它最新的 arXiv 修订版把画面质量和“及时、正确的响应”分开来评。\n\n瓶颈：一段精致的成片可能掩盖漏掉的指令、迟到的反应和前后不一致的状态。只评外观，这些失败基本都测不出来。\n\n机制：这个基准会按时间安排在线输入，并且只让模型看到截至当前已发布的信息。300 个脚本化案例覆盖五类任务，视频时长 15–300 秒，共计划了 1,347 个输入事件。十项指标覆盖四个评测维度，每次运行重复三遍。\n\n收获：测试了 38 个模型、49 种模型—任务组合，发现“看起来合理”和“真正跟上交互”之间差距很大。比如，音画同步做得很好，指令遵循却可能弱得多。结果是按任务区分的，而不是给不同类的系统排一个通用名次。这个开放框架让研究者能更明确地测试响应速度、状态跟踪和时间上的行为。\n\nStreamEval：评测交互式流式视频生成模型\n\n论文：[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.28402|arxiv.org/abs/2610.28402]]\n项目：[[https://streameval.ai|streameval.ai]]\n代码：[[https://github.com/StreamEval/StreamEval|github.com/StreamEval/Str…]]\n我们的报道：[[https://www.jiqizhixin.com/articles/2026-10-27-5|jiqizhixin.com/articles/2026-…]]\n\n📬 #PapersAccepted by Jiqizhixin"}]},{"h":"karminski3","n":"karminski-牙医","av":"media/t/karminski3_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120287542851592682","t":"不是 MiniMax-H3-Image 10s生成一张4K图有点扯了吧? 于是我赶紧看了下是啥魔法...","ts":"2026-11-11 06:48","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"拆解 10 秒出 4K 图原理","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/karminski3/status/2120287542851592682","pm":[2,2,46,6241]}]},{"h":"kimmonismus","n":"Chubby♨️","av":"media/t/kimmonismus_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120186125591646250","t":"1/ I had early access to Google's new Gemini 4 Carbon in Antigravity. I gave it 13 coding briefs, from 3D to websites and apps. Here's what came back. Its very impressive.\n\nFirst: ORRERY. One control drives the gears and folding petals, even in reverse. One follow-up improved the","ts":"2026-11-11 00:05","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"13 个编程任务实测 Carbon","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120186089386512384.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120186089386512384.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2120186125591646250","pm":[44,23,628,42227],"tz":"1/ 我提前在 Antigravity 里用上了谷歌新的 Gemini 4 Carbon。我给了它 13 个编程需求，从 3D 到网站和应用。下面是它交出来的东西。非常惊艳。\n\n第一个：太阳系仪（ORRERY）。一个控件同时驱动齿轮和折叠花瓣，倒着转也行。一次追问就改进了"},{"id":"2120160297503932544","t":"This is such an important win for Fable 5.2. It makes by far the most significant leap in one of the most important benchmarks that measures real-world work.\n\nOn the Remote Labor Index, it completed 41.3% of projects to at least the standard of the human original. Fable 5.1 scored 17.9%. That’s more than twice as many projects successfully completed.\n\nThe test gives AI agents real briefs and files from paid freelance projects, including software development, design and data analysis. Human reviewers compare the results with the original work.\n\nSo yeah, AI comes for real labor now. First slowly, suddenly all at once. \n\nVery important benchmark, very significant jump.","ts":"2026-11-10 22:23","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 完成真实外包活翻倍","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120144670667706369.jpg","type":"photo","w":2510,"h":1436,"t":"media/t/3_2120144670667706369.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2120160297503932544","pm":[80,51,841,36572],"tz":"这是 Fable 5.2 一个非常重要的胜利。在衡量真实工作能力的最重要基准之一上，它实现了迄今最大的一次飞跃。\n\n在 Remote Labor Index（远程劳动指数）上，它完成了 41.3% 的项目，质量至少达到人类原作的水准。Fable 5.1 只有 17.9%。成功完成的项目数量翻了一倍还多。\n\n这个测试会给 AI 智能体真实付费外包项目的需求和文件，包括软件开发、设计和数据分析。再由人工评审把结果和原作进行对比。\n\n所以没错，AI 现在开始来抢真实的工作了。先是慢慢地，然后突然一下子全来了。\n\n非常重要的基准，非常显著的跃升。"}]},{"h":"liyue_ai","n":"李岳","av":"media/t/liyue_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120169676710043707","t":"不到20分钟，用Seedream 5.5制作并上架了一套羊年春节表情包🥳\n\nSeedream 5.5还是太强了，只要给人物参考几乎不会变化，对于要求一致性高的内容非常给力。","ts":"2026-11-10 23:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"20 分钟做春节表情包","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120169124873846784.jpg","type":"photo","w":1472,"h":844,"t":"media/t/3_2120169124873846784.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/liyue_ai/status/2120169676710043707","pm":[3,2,33,3721]}]},{"h":"Lonely__MH","n":"Lonely","av":"media/t/lonely__mh_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120191868654985237","t":"🔥 SGLang 是真快啊，H3-Image 刚开源，里已经适配上了，\n\n用一张 RTX PRO 6000，5 分钟做完一整套周边\n\n以下官方实测信息👇\n\n- DGX Spark：16秒2K图像，85秒4K图像\n\n- 单RTX PRO 6000：3.4秒2K，18.5秒4K\n\n- 单H200：1.9秒2K，10秒4K\n\n- 原生多GPU推理支持\n\n- 固定种子的可重复结果\n\n传送门👇","ts":"2026-11-11 00:28","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"H3-Image 各显卡实测速度","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120191859708534786.jpg","type":"photo","w":1320,"h":2868,"t":"media/t/3_2120191859708534786.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Lonely__MH/status/2120191868654985237","pm":[1,0,16,2135]}]},{"h":"mfranz_on","n":"Marco Franzon","av":"media/t/mfranz_on_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120222853849125120","t":"Qwen4 Tomorrow  [[https://twitter.com/ItsmeAjayKV/status/2119793886721966110|x.com/ItsmeAjayKV/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 02:31","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Qwen4 或明天发布","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120222838271401984.png","type":"photo","w":345,"h":213,"t":"media/t/3_2120222838271401984.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mfranz_on/status/2120222853849125120","pm":[21,6,116,6650],"tz":"Qwen4 明天发布 [[https://twitter.com/ItsmeAjayKV/status/2119793886721966110|x.com/ItsmeAjayKV/st…]]"}]},{"h":"MiniMax_AI","n":"MiniMax (official)","av":"media/t/minimax_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120179737695826420","t":"4K image generation in 10 seconds! ⚡\n\nMeet MiniMax H3-Image.\n\n16 million pixel resolution. Stunning realism. Precise prompt following & editing. Up to 16 reference images. All in 10 seconds.\n\nAnd it's open-weight. 🚀\n\nAvailable now via our API, MiniMax Code, and Hailuo AI — with 50% off 16MP+ generations during launch week!\n\nCan't wait to see what you create. 🔥 \nHugging Face: [[http://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image|huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/Mini…]]\nAPI: [[http://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/image-generation|platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/im…]]\nMiniMax Code:  [[http://code.minimax.io/about|code.minimax.io/about]]","ts":"2026-11-10 23:40","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"开放权重的 4K 生图模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/7_2120179694725218304.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/7_2120179694725218304.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/MiniMax_AI/status/2120179737695826420","pm":[197,268,2993,414676],"tz":"10 秒生成 4K 图！⚡\n\n来认识一下 MiniMax H3-Image。\n\n1600 万像素分辨率。惊人的真实感。精准遵循提示词和编辑指令。最多 16 张参考图。全部只要 10 秒。\n\n而且它是开放权重的。🚀\n\n现已通过我们的 API、MiniMax Code 和海螺 AI 提供——发布周内 1600 万像素及以上的生成打五折！\n\n迫不及待想看你们的作品。🔥 \nHugging Face：[[http://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image|huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/Mini…]]\nAPI：[[http://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/image-generation|platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/im…]]\nMiniMax Code：[[http://code.minimax.io/about|code.minimax.io/about]]"}]},{"h":"MinLiBuilds","n":"实践哥 Li","av":"media/t/minlibuilds_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120130405907276113","t":"😭 我不会是最后一个知道的吧? effort 可以无极变速了。\n\nmax/xhigh/high/Low/medium 随意变化，丝滑执行，缓存依然命中。\n\nFable5.2, Opus5.5全部支持了！","ts":"2026-11-10 20:24","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"思考强度可随时切换","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120125755476848640.png","type":"photo","w":1224,"h":272,"t":"media/t/3_2120125755476848640.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/MinLiBuilds/status/2120130405907276113","pm":[5,1,38,13679]}]},{"h":"ModelScope2022","n":"ModelScope","av":"media/t/modelscope2022_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120124432244998499","t":"LingBot-Touch has landed: an open-source tactile foundation model for transferring touch-based skills across robot hands, sensors, and manipulation tasks. 📜 Apache-2.0 License.\n🤖 [[https://modelscope.ai/collections/Robbyant/LingBot-Touch|modelscope.ai/collections/Ro…]]\n\n🖐️ Pretrained on touch at scale: Learns from 4,983 hours of tactile recordings, 1.33B frames, and 464K interaction episodes across piezoresistive, magnetic, and visuotactile sensors.\n📊 Built for dexterous manipulation: Evaluated across 26 real-world tasks and 12 simulated RL tasks, including fragile-object handling, deformable objects, and bimanual coordination.\n🔄 Transfer across sensors and hands: A shared Haptic Transformer maps heterogeneous tactile signals into one reusable representation, enabling transfer to unseen tactile sensors and real-world dexterous hands.\n⚡ High-frequency and lightweight: The HaT-Tiny encoder uses just 5.46M parameters while supporting responsive downstream tactile inference.\n🛠️ Ready to build with: Tiny and Small checkpoints, inference code, sensor interfaces, and sample data are released for three tactile modalities.","ts":"2026-11-10 20:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"开源机器人触觉基础模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/7_2120124357460557824.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/7_2120124357460557824.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ModelScope2022/status/2120124432244998499","pm":[0,1,21,1147],"tz":"LingBot-Touch 来了：一个开源的触觉基础模型，能把基于触觉的技能迁移到不同的机械手、传感器和操作任务上。📜 Apache-2.0 许可。\n🤖 [[https://modelscope.ai/collections/Robbyant/LingBot-Touch|modelscope.ai/collections/Ro…]]\n\n🖐️ 大规模触觉预训练：从 4,983 小时触觉记录、13.3 亿帧和 46.4 万个交互片段中学习，覆盖压阻式、磁式和视触觉传感器。\n📊 为灵巧操作而生：在 26 个真实任务和 12 个模拟强化学习任务上评测，包括易碎物品、可变形物体和双手协作。\n🔄 跨传感器、跨机械手迁移：共享的 Haptic Transformer 把各种不同的触觉信号映射成一种可复用的表示，能迁移到没见过的触觉传感器和真实灵巧手上。\n⚡ 高频且轻量：HaT-Tiny 编码器只有 546 万参数，同时支持响应迅速的下游触觉推理。\n🛠️ 拿来就能用：已发布 Tiny 和 Small 检查点、推理代码、传感器接口，以及三种触觉模态的示例数据。"}]},{"h":"mylifcc","n":"lifcc","av":"media/t/mylifcc_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120192260868382831","t":"Kimi终于有算力了！！月之暗面在甘肃庆阳租下 32 台英伟达顶级 B300 服务器，总估值 4.32 亿元\n\nB300 属于英伟达 Blackwell Ultra 系列，是目前市面上性能最强的 AI 训练与推理芯片，也是美国严格限制向中国出口的产品。以前阿里、字节跳动等国内大厂为了合规拿算力，通常的做法是去马来西亚等东南亚国家或欧洲的数据中心远程租用；但这次泄露的信贷备案文件显示，这批机器直接部署在中国境内的甘肃庆阳。\n\n这批服务器归一家叫凌美芯（北京）科技的公司所有，而这家公司官网对外的介绍是一家大疆无人机经销商。凌美芯拿着这 32 台服务器，外加月之暗面算力合同里约 3.456 亿元的预期服务收入做质押担保，向北京中关村银行借了 2 亿元人民币贷款。\n\n这32 台服务器的估值是 4.32 亿元人民币（约 6480 万美元），折合单台服务器作价 1350 万元人民币，大约是美国正常市场价的 3.5 倍。","ts":"2026-11-11 00:30","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Kimi 新增大批算力","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120170771117162496.jpg","type":"photo","w":2000,"h":1334,"t":"media/t/3_2120170771117162496.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mylifcc/status/2120192260868382831","pm":[10,4,74,23183]}]},{"h":"OfficialLoganK","n":"Logan Kilpatrick","av":"media/t/officiallogank_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120186016254624039","t":"Gemini 4 Carbon, now available in the Gemini API and to Ultra subscribers!\n\nJust a few weeks after Argon was launched, this model makes significant progress on lots of the feedback from Argon and pushes the frontier in cyber, knowledge work, and code! It's a great model : )","ts":"2026-11-11 00:05","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Gemini 4 Carbon 正式开放","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/OfficialLoganK/status/2120186016254624039","pm":[539,182,3667,269107],"tz":"Gemini 4 Carbon 现已在 Gemini API 中上线，Ultra 订阅用户也能用了！\n\nArgon 发布才几周，这个模型就针对大家对 Argon 的很多反馈做了明显改进，在网络安全、知识工作和写代码上都推到了最前沿！这是个很棒的模型 : )"}]},{"h":"ollama","n":"ollama","av":"media/t/ollama_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120179893170487608","t":"Ripple 65-B Preview from @RicursiveAI is on Ollama. Built for agentic coding, with up to 1M tokens of context. Run it locally with full zero data retention.","ts":"2026-11-10 23:40","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"可本地跑的编程模型","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/ollama/status/2120179893170487608","pm":[24,6,159,19041],"tz":"来自 @RicursiveAI 的 Ripple 65-B 预览版已上架 Ollama。专为智能体编程打造，最多支持 100 万 token 上下文。可在本地运行，数据完全不留存。"}]},{"h":"omarsar0","n":"elvis","av":"media/t/omarsar0_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120253922933956644","t":"Great paper from Meta with practical tips for tuning LLM judges.\n\nThis one is on keeping LLM code judges calibrated and tested on a deployed coding agent.\n\nLLM judges often decide whether an agent's code change is good. But their prompts go stale every time the agent changes.","ts":"2026-11-11 04:35","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Meta 调校 AI 裁判的经验","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120253918399905792.png","type":"photo","w":1640,"h":1898,"t":"media/t/3_2120253918399905792.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2120253922933956644","pm":[27,9,65,5138],"tz":"Meta 的一篇好论文，讲调校 LLM 评委的实用技巧。\n\n这篇讲的是如何让给代码打分的 LLM 评委保持校准，并在一个已上线的编程智能体上做了测试。\n\nLLM 评委经常负责判断智能体改的代码好不好。但每次智能体一更新，它们的提示词就过时了。"},{"id":"2120160305347260443","t":"Learn to build a custom harness, folks.\n\nThis Microsoft work builds a harness to improve long-context reasoning without synthetic data or post-training.\n\n(bookmark it)\n\nThey show that Llama3-8B gains 64.18 points on average across long-context benchmarks with no training at all.","ts":"2026-11-10 22:23","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"不训练也提升长文推理","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120160301534568448.jpg","type":"photo","w":1488,"h":1912,"t":"media/t/3_2120160301534568448.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2120160305347260443","pm":[61,23,131,8524],"tz":"各位，学着自己搭一个定制的“外壳”（harness）吧。\n\n微软这项工作搭了一个外壳，不用合成数据、也不用后训练，就能提升长上下文推理能力。\n\n（建议收藏）\n\n他们展示了 Llama3-8B 在不做任何训练的情况下，在长上下文基准上平均提高了 64.18 分。"}]},{"h":"OpenAI","n":"OpenAI","av":"media/t/openai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120216592395174382","t":"Now in beta: Businesses in ChatGPT.\n\nClaim your business, manage your information, and get insights on how people engage with you.\n\nEligible businesses can also build a Business Agent to answer customers’ questions and help them explore what you offer.\n\n[[https://openai.com/index/introducing-businesses-chatgpt/|openai.com/index/introduc…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 02:06","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"ChatGPT 开放商家入驻和 AI 客服","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120214011451170817.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120214011451170817.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2120216592395174382","pm":[782,818,11230,2359821],"tz":"测试版上线：Businesses in ChatGPT（ChatGPT 商家版）。\n\n认领你的商家，管理你的信息，并了解用户是怎么和你互动的。\n\n符合条件的商家还能搭建一个 Business Agent，回答顾客的问题，帮他们了解你提供的东西。\n\n[[https://openai.com/index/introducing-businesses-chatgpt/|openai.com/index/introduc…]]"},{"id":"2120202353907486826","t":"We're turning our lessons from defending OpenAI into practical tools for our customers. On Thursday, join us at Cyber at the Frontier, a live keynote, for our latest cyber announcements.\n\nWorking with our frontier models, we've identified and resolved important vulnerabilities in our own code and infrastructure. That experience is informing the tools and playbooks we're building to help other security teams strengthen their defenses.\n\n@gdb shares what we've learned and why security teams should keep putting the latest models to work as capabilities improve.\n\nTune in on November 12 at 10 a.m. PT: [[https://openai.com/cyber-at-the-frontier/|openai.com/cyber-at-the-f…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 01:10","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"OpenAI 周四网安发布会预告","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120202060255928320.jpg","type":"video","w":3840,"h":2160,"t":"media/t/13_2120202060255928320.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2120202353907486826","pm":[412,111,1713,286942],"tz":"我们正把保护 OpenAI 自身的经验，变成给客户用的实用工具。周四欢迎来看“Cyber at the Frontier”直播主题发布会，了解我们最新的网络安全发布。\n\n借助我们的前沿模型，我们在自己的代码和基础设施里发现并修复了重要漏洞。这些经验正在指导我们打造工具和操作手册，帮助其他安全团队加强防御。\n\n@gdb 会分享我们学到了什么，以及为什么安全团队应该随着模型能力提升，持续把最新模型用起来。\n\n11 月 12 日太平洋时间上午 10 点开播：[[https://openai.com/cyber-at-the-frontier/|openai.com/cyber-at-the-f…]]"}]},{"h":"opencode","n":"OpenCode","av":"media/t/opencode_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120256195017781692","t":"Inkling 2 Small is now free on OpenCode for a limited time\n\n- 1M Context\n- Multi-modal\n- 594B MoE, 17B active\n\nLimited to certain regions","ts":"2026-11-11 04:44","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"大模型限时免费白嫖","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/opencode/status/2120256195017781692","pm":[32,23,957,33638],"tz":"Inkling 2 Small 现在在 OpenCode 上限时免费\n\n- 100 万上下文\n- 多模态\n- 5940 亿参数 MoE，激活 170 亿\n\n仅限部分地区"},{"id":"2120230826898293238","t":"Gemini 4 Carbon and Claude Fable 5.2 are now available in OpenCode","ts":"2026-11-11 03:03","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"两大新模型接入 OpenCode","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/opencode/status/2120230826898293238","pm":[82,64,2298,64176],"tz":"Gemini 4 Carbon 和 Claude Fable 5.2 现已上线 OpenCode"}]},{"h":"poolmoon6","n":"寒塘poolmoon","av":"media/t/poolmoon6_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120299464267350109","t":"Fable 5.2 版波音787-9科普网站来了！这次仅用时2小时8分钟，约2910万token，API等值约45美元。推理强度设为high。\n\n视频仍采用Opus 5.5 high 制作。\n\n访问地址：\n[[https://xiaozhenliu.github.io/boeing-fable-5-2/|xiaozhenliu.github.io/boeing-fable-5…]]  [[https://twitter.com/poolmoon6/status/2119727942054133857|x.com/poolmoon6/stat…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 07:36","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Fable 2 小时做科普网站","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120296251489165312.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120296251489165312.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/poolmoon6/status/2120299464267350109","pm":[9,1,11,419]}]},{"h":"rasbt","n":"Sebastian Raschka","av":"media/t/rasbt_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120192452287963540","t":"Currently working towards a bigger open LLM roundup. But in the meantime, just one of the interesting trends that stood out. I.e., looks like the transition from full to hybrid attention continues.\n\nIn 2025, there were still lots of full attention models, with a shift to \"some full attention\" hybrids.\n\nIn the first half of 2026, the trend towards \"some full attention\" hybrids continued.\n\nAnd now, in the second half of 2026, we have a 50/50 split between \"some full attention\" hybrids and models that don't use full attention at all anymore. And yes, there are also no full attention models anymore. \n\nThe plot legend here means,\n\n- Full attention throughout = Global MHA, GQA, dense MLA, CCA in EVERY layer. \n- Some full attention = Full global attn mixed with: sliding-window/chunked attention, Gated DeltaNet, KDA, Mamba-2, Lightning Attention, convolutions, sparse attention. \n- No full attention = Zero dense global layers.\n\nThe main implication is that the trend goes towards making long contexts cheaper to use. This means, it makes the architectures more suitable for long documents and conversations, large code bases, and of course agent usecases that rely on a lot of tool calls.\n\nIn particular, there are two distinct efficiency gains here:\n\n1) Less attention computation, since sparse attention and the like select tokens or blocks from the context and performs the expensive attention operation from only that subset. (Note that it can still retrieve information from distant positions.)\n\n2) Less memory for retaining context in some architectures, meaning that recurrent layers such as Gated DeltaNet maintain a fixed-size state. Of course, this saves memory, but compressing the history creates challenges for exact retrieval, so they are usually intermixed with traditional attention methods (sparse or full).","ts":"2026-11-11 00:30","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"大模型注意力架构新趋势","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120192401423716352.jpg","type":"photo","w":2110,"h":1376,"t":"media/t/3_2120192401423716352.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/rasbt/status/2120192452287963540","pm":[42,38,385,16180],"tz":"我正在准备一份更大的开源大模型盘点。不过先说一个比较显眼的有趣趋势：从全注意力向混合注意力的转变还在继续。\n\n2025 年，全注意力模型还很多，同时开始转向“部分全注意力”的混合架构。\n\n2026 年上半年，向“部分全注意力”混合架构转变的趋势继续。\n\n而现在，2026 年下半年，“部分全注意力”混合架构和完全不用全注意力的模型各占一半。没错，已经没有纯全注意力模型了。\n\n图例的意思是：\n\n- 全程全注意力 = 每一层都用全局 MHA、GQA、稠密 MLA、CCA。\n- 部分全注意力 = 全局全注意力混合了：滑动窗口/分块注意力、Gated DeltaNet、KDA、Mamba-2、Lightning Attention、卷积、稀疏注意力。\n- 无全注意力 = 没有任何稠密全局层。\n\n主要的意义是，趋势是让长上下文用起来更便宜。也就是说，这让架构更适合长文档和长对话、大型代码库，当然还有依赖大量工具调用的智能体场景。\n\n具体来说，这里有两种不同的效率提升：\n\n1）注意力计算更少，因为稀疏注意力之类的方法会从上下文里挑出部分 token 或块，只在这个子集上做昂贵的注意力运算。（注意，它仍然能从很远的位置检索信息。）\n\n2）某些架构保留上下文所需的内存更少，也就是像 Gated DeltaNet 这样的循环层维持一个固定大小的状态。这当然省内存，但压缩历史会让精确检索变难，所以它们通常会和传统注意力方法（稀疏或全注意力）混合使用。"}]},{"h":"ravisparikh","n":"Ravi Parikh","av":"media/t/ravisparikh_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120291230068490380","t":"My version, made one-shot by Fable 5.2 in vork. Rendered in 3.5s on M5 Macbook Pro.  [[https://twitter.com/BubbleBrain/status/2120115320992207309|x.com/BubbleBrain/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 07:03","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 一次生成写实渲染","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120289314936610816.jpg","type":"photo","w":2000,"h":1333,"t":"media/t/3_2120289314936610816.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ravisparikh/status/2120291230068490380","pm":[1,2,19,1099],"tz":"我的版本，用 Fable 5.2 在 vork 里一次生成。在 M5 MacBook Pro 上渲染只用了 3.5 秒。 [[https://twitter.com/BubbleBrain/status/2120115320992207309|x.com/BubbleBrain/st…]]"}]},{"h":"RayFernando1337","n":"Ray Fernando","av":"media/t/rayfernando1337_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120185156568805558","t":"I used to pay someone thousands of dollars for 3 clips a week. This agent is literally clipping my live streams and making shorts for me while I'm literally sleeping.","ts":"2026-11-11 00:01","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 自动剪直播短视频","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120185124343930880.jpg","type":"video","w":1080,"h":1920,"t":"media/t/13_2120185124343930880.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/RayFernando1337/status/2120185156568805558","pm":[10,2,51,3577],"tz":"以前我每周花几千美元请人剪 3 条片段。现在这个智能体在我睡觉的时候，就在帮我剪直播片段、做短视频。"}]},{"h":"rohanpaul_ai","n":"Rohan Paul","av":"media/t/rohanpaul_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120245649790885952","t":"New Duke and Princeton paper finds that, at equal compute, many small agent teams in parallel beat both solo-agent best-of-N and one giant team.\n\nWith the same budget of 100 AI agents, running 10 small teams of 10 agents in parallel and keeping the best team’s result beat both 100 solo agents and one 100-agent team.\n\nWith a verifier, teams usually run many solo agents and keep the best, but gains flatten fast. One large team does better at first, then stops improving as it grows.\n\nThey split the agent budget into teams of 10 that share a forum, then keep the best team's result. Teamwork raises each attempt's average, and several teams still give many tries.\n\nIf a verifier can score your agents' work, split the budget into several small teams that share notes, and keep the best team's answer.","ts":"2026-11-11 04:02","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"多个小团队智能体更强","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120245614919512064.jpg","type":"photo","w":1634,"h":2001,"t":"media/t/3_2120245614919512064.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120245649790885952","pm":[18,6,57,3934],"tz":"杜克和普林斯顿的新论文发现，在算力相同的情况下，并行跑很多个小的智能体团队，比单个智能体多次尝试取最好（best-of-N）和一个超大团队都要强。\n\n同样是 100 个 AI 智能体的预算，并行跑 10 个各 10 人的小团队、保留最好那个团队的结果，胜过 100 个单独的智能体，也胜过一个 100 人的大团队。\n\n有验证器时，大家通常会跑很多单独的智能体然后保留最好的，但收益很快就到顶了。一个大团队一开始表现更好，但规模变大后就不再提升。\n\n他们把智能体预算拆成每队 10 个、共享一个论坛的团队，然后保留表现最好的团队的结果。团队合作提高了每次尝试的平均水平，多个团队又保证了多次尝试。\n\n如果有验证器能给你的智能体的工作打分，就把预算拆成几个共享笔记的小团队，保留最好那个团队的答案。"},{"id":"2120209275515736120","t":"Great new study on model routing.\n\nFrom University of California, Berkeley + other labs \n\nFinds that model routers pay off significantly by saving money, averaging 8.82X more quality per unit cost while losing under 0.5 points.\n\nRouters pick which model handles each input, hoping to match the best model for less or beat it. Most routing research has studied only language models.\n\nRoute Anything ran 452 candidate models and policies on the same inputs across 25 benchmarks, from text QA to robot control. They trained routers on these 374,401 scored runs and measured both quality and cost.\n\nA perfect per-input router would beat the best single model by 5.4 points, but learned routers gained only 0.3 across 16 benchmarks. On coding tasks, routing reached 25.5× the dollar efficiency of always calling Opus 4.6 at a 0.44-point loss.\n\nUse routers mainly to move work to cheaper models when quality is close, and compare candidates on the same inputs before trusting gains.","ts":"2026-11-11 01:37","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"模型路由省钱研究","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120208936079175680.jpg","type":"photo","w":1414,"h":1862,"t":"media/t/3_2120208936079175680.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2120209275515736120","pm":[15,5,22,2676],"tz":"一项关于模型路由的很棒的新研究。\n\n来自加州大学伯克利分校和其他实验室\n\n发现模型路由器能显著省钱：平均每单位成本获得的质量提高 8.82 倍，而质量损失不到 0.5 分。\n\n路由器会决定每个输入交给哪个模型处理，希望用更少的钱达到最好模型的水平，甚至超过它。大多数路由研究只研究了语言模型。\n\nRoute Anything 在 25 个基准上（从文本问答到机器人控制），用同样的输入跑了 452 个候选模型和策略。他们用这 374,401 次打过分的运行训练路由器，同时衡量质量和成本。\n\n一个完美的逐输入路由器能比最好的单个模型高 5.4 分，但学出来的路由器在 16 个基准上只提高了 0.3 分。在编程任务上，路由的花钱效率达到一直调用 Opus 4.6 的 25.5 倍，质量只损失 0.44 分。\n\n路由器主要用来在质量接近时把工作转给更便宜的模型，在相信收益之前，先在同样的输入上比较各个候选。"}]},{"h":"Saccc_c","n":"Sac","av":"media/t/saccc_c_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120152336350036100","t":"这绝对是最低门槛上手AI 3D创作、游戏制作的方法！\n\n场景构造、人物建模、绑骨+动作都能一句话快速生成，无需任何其他专业软件\n\n核心就是借助 @ViggleAI 的 Pinoc平台+其发布的JST 2世界模型。我真心觉得世界模型是3D创作的一个新切入点，可以帮助大家快速将自己脑中的想法落地","ts":"2026-11-10 21:51","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"一句话做 3D 和游戏","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120134486554005504.jpg","type":"video","w":1906,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2120134486554005504.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Saccc_c/status/2120152336350036100","pm":[11,7,55,4146]}]},{"h":"shao__meng","n":"meng shao","av":"media/t/shao__meng_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120117639125348470","t":"评测驱动开发是什么？LangChain 用一个 Agent 改造案例说明：先定义成功，再验证改动\n\n给 Agent 增加一个工具，整体得分提高了，原本正确的行为却可能退步。 @LangChain 团队 @divyasan0 这篇文章讨论的评测驱动开发（eval-driven development），就是把“感觉变好了”变成可验证的开发流程：先定义预期行为、建立评测和基线，再修改系统、逐项比较。\n\n[[https://www.langchain.com/blog/what-is-eval-driven-development|langchain.com/blog/what-is-e…]]\n\n# 先写清楚什么算对，再动手开发\n\n以内部文档助手为例：已有文档搜索和联网搜索，现在要增加创建 IT 工单的能力。“笔记本连不上 VPN”应该开单，“怎么连接 VPN”只是咨询，不该开单；原来的查询能力也不能受影响。\n\n这些要求要变成具体、可判定的评测，而不是笼统的“回答有帮助”。数据优先来自真实对话，没有流量时可以手写。能用代码检查的就用代码，例如是否调用了正确工具；需要模型判断时，先确认评分与人工判断一致。修改前跑一遍基线，才能知道后续改动究竟改善了什么。\n\n# 总分提高，不代表每种行为都变好\n\n用 8 条样例演示：没有工单工具时通过 5 条；加入工具后通过 7 条，却把“怎么连接 VPN”也开成了工单。\n\n查看执行记录后发现，工具说明写成“用于 VPN 和笔记本问题”，范围太宽。收窄说明后，8 条全部通过。问题不一定出在模型能力，也可能只是工具说明让它误解了适用范围。","ts":"2026-11-10 19:33","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"评测驱动的 Agent 开发","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120117626878017537.jpg","type":"photo","w":2400,"h":2400,"t":"media/t/3_2120117626878017537.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/shao__meng/status/2120117639125348470","pm":[21,2,7,1103]}]},{"h":"simonw","n":"Simon Willison","av":"media/t/simonw_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120258951594037732","t":"Gemini 4 Carbon is good at pelican SVGs, but that's nothing new for Gemini\n\n\"Make a three js animation where yonkers stands up as a big mech (cool stand up motion) and stomps around manhattan and queens and Brooklyn, use openstreetmap mapping data\"\n[[https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/10/llm-gemini/|simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/10/ll…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 04:55","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Carbon 鹈鹕与 3D 动画实测","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120258832077299712.jpg","type":"video","w":1028,"h":720,"t":"media/t/13_2120258832077299712.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/simonw/status/2120258951594037732","pm":[57,2,174,17491],"tz":"Gemini 4 Carbon 很会画鹈鹕 SVG，不过这对 Gemini 来说不算新鲜事\n\n“做一个 three.js 动画：扬克斯变成一个巨型机甲站起来（站起来的动作要酷），在曼哈顿、皇后区和布鲁克林到处踩，使用 OpenStreetMap 地图数据”\n[[https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/10/llm-gemini/|simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/10/ll…]]"}]},{"h":"testingcatalog","n":"🚨 AI News | TestingCatalog","av":"media/t/testingcatalog_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120245174752137605","t":"BREAKING 🔥: Stripe acquired OpenRouter!!! \n\n> Stripe: \"Stripe is building the economic infrastructure for AI.\"\n\n> OpenRouter: \"Our commitment to neutrality stays the same. Models and providers compete on quality, reliability, and price.\"\n\nThis acquisition is quite a huge move. From my POV, OpenRouter is one of the biggest assets for the future AI economy. As demand for AI tokens continues to grow, having control over this infrastructure will be the key.\n\nAI tokens will be a currency one day 👀","ts":"2026-11-11 04:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Stripe 收购 OpenRouter","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120244944191332352.jpg","type":"photo","w":400,"h":400,"t":"media/t/3_2120244944191332352.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2120244960477818880.jpg","type":"photo","w":400,"h":400,"t":"media/t/3_2120244960477818880.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2120245174752137605","pm":[22,5,129,7567],"tz":"重磅 🔥：Stripe 收购了 OpenRouter！！！\n\n> Stripe：“Stripe 正在打造 AI 的经济基础设施。”\n\n> OpenRouter：“我们对中立的承诺不变。各家模型和服务商依然在质量、可靠性和价格上竞争。”\n\n这次收购是个大动作。在我看来，OpenRouter 是未来 AI 经济里最重要的资产之一。随着 AI token 的需求持续增长，掌控这块基础设施将是关键。\n\nAI token 总有一天会变成一种货币 👀"}]},{"h":"thdxr","n":"dax","av":"media/t/thdxr_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120222008093151392","t":"more seriously, it's a model i think that's very useful to mix in with whatever model you're currently using\n\ntry it out that way. ask your primary model to spawn some carbon subagents when you have a tricky problem or you want to try to simplify some code","ts":"2026-11-11 02:28","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"把 Carbon 当子智能体混用","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/thdxr/status/2120222008093151392","pm":[18,3,216,15757],"tz":"说正经的，我觉得这个模型很适合和你现在用的模型混着用\n\n可以这样试：遇到棘手问题，或者想简化一些代码的时候，让你的主力模型去拉起几个 Carbon 子智能体"}]},{"h":"thorstenball","n":"Thorsten Ball","av":"media/t/thorstenball_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120199882677833826","t":"Amp now has a home for all the beautiful things you build.\n\n[[https://ampcode.com/news/boxes|ampcode.com/news/boxes]]","ts":"2026-11-11 01:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Amp 给作品安了家","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120197614628900867.jpg","type":"photo","w":2506,"h":2728,"t":"media/t/3_2120197614628900867.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2120199882677833826","pm":[22,19,220,83673],"tz":"Amp 现在给你做出来的所有好东西安了一个家。\n\n[[https://ampcode.com/news/boxes|ampcode.com/news/boxes]]"}]},{"h":"Vincent_AINotes","n":"Vincent","av":"media/t/vincent_ainotes_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120154339012669570","t":"Anthropic 11 月 12 日起执行更严格的地区封禁政策。\n\n1. 人在中国，不管什么国籍，都不支持。\n2. 企业注册地或总部在不支持地区，即使员工在美国，也不支持。\n3. 中国个人或实体直接、间接控制的美国公司，连在美国的员工也可能受到影响。\n\n以后用 Claude，不光要查你在哪里，还要查你给谁打工、公司又是谁控制的。","ts":"2026-11-10 21:59","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Claude 地区限制收紧","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120153641491570688.jpg","type":"photo","w":2510,"h":1192,"t":"media/t/3_2120153641491570688.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Vincent_AINotes/status/2120154339012669570","pm":[18,6,59,27265]},{"id":"2120141452370194549","t":"Claude 封号维权，终于有人把钱要回来了！\n\n从 10 月 1 日开始，和 Anthropic 拉扯了整整一个多月，期间多次发邮件、提交投诉，终于在 11 月 10 日收到退款确认。\n\n这次比较关键的是 BBB（美国商业改进局）和加州总检察长办公室（CA AG）两个投诉渠道。\n\n据当事人分享，BBB 的协调专员多次催促 Anthropic 处理，他自己则持续给 Anthropic 发邮件，每次都抄送 BBB 的协调专员，前后大概发了 5 次。\n\n最终，Anthropic 客服确认已经处理 Claude Max 订阅退款，预计 5–10 个工作日原路退回。\n\n从 10 月 1 日到 11 月 10 日，整整 40 天，终于把钱拿回来了。\n\n看来被封号之后，也不是只能认栽。多渠道投诉、持续跟进，至少有人成功了。\n\n把这个案例分享出来，希望还在和 A 社拉扯的朋友也能顺利退款！","ts":"2026-11-10 21:08","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Claude 封号退款维权案例","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120141308669153280.jpg","type":"photo","w":1206,"h":1061,"t":"media/t/3_2120141308669153280.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2120141311760347136.jpg","type":"photo","w":1206,"h":1471,"t":"media/t/3_2120141311760347136.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Vincent_AINotes/status/2120141452370194549","pm":[21,10,136,21579]}]},{"h":"vista8","n":"向阳乔木","av":"media/t/vista8_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120319562675851368","t":"每天收藏记录很多碎片内容，如不总结回顾，意义就不大。\n\n给乔木闪记 Jot 增加了每日 AI 总结回顾。\n\n支持云端模型和本地 CLI（免 API 配置），定时按指定风格总结，随时查看历史日记总结。\n\n另外，产品新增 Windows 版本，感谢网友PR贡献。\n\n在线更新或下载更新，地址见评论区","ts":"2026-11-11 08:55","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"笔记工具加每日 AI 总结","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120317845158625280.jpg","type":"photo","w":1218,"h":1038,"t":"media/t/3_2120317845158625280.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2120318244246769664.jpg","type":"photo","w":1380,"h":1458,"t":"media/t/3_2120318244246769664.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2120319562675851368","pm":[7,0,3,842]},{"id":"2120099636149153857","t":"开源一个新项目，让 Grok bot 每天抓取分析 X 上的海外优质长文，转写成中文，发布为网站。\n\n可改造成自己喜欢的账号，如盯着某些研究员和模型公司发布的链接。\n\n这些信息价值经常很高，能覆盖海外的一些实时热点。\n\n体验网站和开源地址见评论区","ts":"2026-11-10 18:21","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"开源 X 长文中文化网站项目","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120098281284149248.jpg","type":"photo","w":2872,"h":1952,"t":"media/t/3_2120098281284149248.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2120099636149153857","pm":[91,45,381,24434]}]},{"h":"wquguru","n":"WquGuru","av":"media/t/wquguru_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120177800288378938","t":"Fable 5.2对画画和音乐的品味提升了整整一个数量级！！！\n\n画画：500+行Python代码叠加8584笔\n作曲：同样Python生成，再也不是Opus5.5那种单调到刺耳的音乐，而是马林巴、钢琴、钟琴、铺底长音不错的搭配","ts":"2026-11-10 23:32","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"Fable 画画作曲审美大涨","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120175408390012929.jpg","type":"video","w":1440,"h":1052,"t":"media/t/13_2120175408390012929.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/wquguru/status/2120177800288378938","pm":[5,0,19,1871]},{"id":"2120157134604447901","t":"隐隐感觉跨平台框架会慢慢凋零。\n\n一周时间，五个平台纯原生代码实现：\n\nMacOS 3.0 万行 SwiftUI\nWindows 1.8 万行 WPF\nLinux 2.0 万行 GTK 3\nAndroid 1.4 万行 Kotlin\n加上在写还没发的 iOS 端，五端合计约 8.7 万行（ps. 占Claude Ultra周用量大概80%）\n\n做跨平台开发的朋友，你们怎么看？  [[https://twitter.com/wquguru/status/2119264966125711494|x.com/wquguru/status…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 22:10","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI 一周写五端原生应用","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120157106838056960.jpg","type":"photo","w":870,"h":1661,"t":"media/t/3_2120157106838056960.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/wquguru/status/2120157134604447901","pm":[14,0,16,2995]}]},{"h":"xiaomovps","n":"小墨同学","av":"media/t/xiaomovps_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120184910665424900","t":"现在 AI Agent 都能自己操作电脑了，但我发现一个问题，好像很少有人真正关注它的安全性\n\n尤其是 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 这些工具，我平时也经常使用，很多时候直接给它终端权限、文件读写权限，甚至让它自己操作浏览器\n\n用起来确实方便，但权限越大，潜在的安全风险也就越值得关注\n\n最近看到 GCSA","ts":"2026-11-11 00:00","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"AI Agent 权限安全提醒","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120184900645273600.jpg","type":"photo","w":2048,"h":1280,"t":"media/t/3_2120184900645273600.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2120184900531933184.jpg","type":"photo","w":2048,"h":1280,"t":"media/t/3_2120184900531933184.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaomovps/status/2120184910665424900","pm":[8,1,7,48773]},{"id":"2120169092628001219","t":"Herdr 终于推出移动端了！现在出门也能直接接管电脑上的 AI Coding Agent 了🔥\n\n之前我就推荐过 Herdr，它算是我比较喜欢的多 Agent 管理工具之一，没想到现在连 iOS 和 Android 都支持了，我等了这么久 终于等到了\n\n我也第一时间体验了一下，发现整体还挺不错的，尤其是我平时常用的 Pi Agent、Claude","ts":"2026-11-10 22:57","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"手机遥控电脑上的 AI 编程","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120168692650852352.jpg","type":"video","w":1180,"h":2556,"t":"media/t/13_2120168692650852352.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaomovps/status/2120169092628001219","pm":[8,2,25,3568]}]},{"h":"xiax0603","n":"xiax｜AI & Agents","av":"media/t/xiax0603_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120254564691787810","t":"GPT 6.2 系列即将到来\n\n-gpt 6.2 astra\n-gpt 6.2 sol\n-gpt 6.2 terra\n-gpt 6.2 luna\n\n官方文档来源：[[https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/java/resources/responses/methods/compact|developers.openai.com/api/reference/…]]  [[https://twitter.com/xiax0603/status/2120250993241907680|x.com/xiax0603/statu…]]","ts":"2026-11-11 04:37","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"GPT-6.2 系列文档曝光","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2120254555820838912.jpg","type":"photo","w":1220,"h":2032,"t":"media/t/3_2120254555820838912.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiax0603/status/2120254564691787810","pm":[9,4,14,7971]}]},{"h":"yupi996","n":"程序员鱼皮","av":"media/t/yupi996_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120116439382372857","t":"感谢 Fable 5.2，让大黄狗阿皮带你沉浸式感受「瑶琳仙境」的溶洞之美 ❤️\n\n↓ 完整提示词放评论区了","ts":"2026-11-10 19:28","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"一段提示词做 3D 溶洞网页","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2120086201822855169.jpg","type":"video","w":3448,"h":1984,"t":"media/t/13_2120086201822855169.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/yupi996/status/2120116439382372857","pm":[5,0,5,2112]}]},{"h":"zachlloydtweets","n":"Zach Lloyd","av":"media/t/zachlloydtweets_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2120245800924262816","t":"Lots of discussion about what a \"software factory\" is.\n\nAlso useful to call out what a software factory is not:\n1/ A loose collection of automations around cloud agents\n2/ A team of \"AI Engineers\" that developers manage interactively\n3/ A set of skills and MCPs that individual","ts":"2026-11-11 04:02","ed":"2026-11-11/night","why":"什么才算“软件工厂”","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/zachlloydtweets/status/2120245800924262816","pm":[31,7,83,6763],"tz":"关于“软件工厂”到底是什么，大家讨论了很多。\n\n同样有必要说说软件工厂“不是”什么：\n1/ 围绕云端智能体凑起来的一堆零散自动化\n2/ 一支由开发者交互式管理的“AI 工程师”团队\n3/ 一套由个人……的技能和 MCP"}]}]);
